      "observations": [
        "The entire six-path historical diff adds appmenu_exportmobile under the app-menu Tools view, routes it to openOptionsDialog(paneQrExport), adds a Fluent label/accesskey and packages the small upload icon through jar.inc.mn, icons.css and panelUI.css. The current control routes to openPreferencesTab(paneQrExport), retains separate appmenu localization and lowercase p, and selects mobile-export-sm. The retained upload resources remain packaged, but their continued presence does not make them the current consumer icon.",
